 one third of the Villa Hadriana in Tivoli (only Wikipedia says so; the excavated villa is given as about 16 hectares by Wikipedia and the Saint-Raymond museum, and Hadrian''s Villa as at least a square kilometre, so a third does not fit) [UNVERIFIABLE, no proving quote: None]"}]'::jsonb),
