n Iron Age sword at Stanwick [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stanwick_Iron_Age_Fortifications]; The Iron Age sword was still in its ash wood scabbard [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stanwick_Iron_Age_Fortifications]; Wheeler also found, nearby, the skull of a severed head [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stanwick_Iron_Age_Fortifications]"}]'::jsonb),
